items.prompt:
{
  "summary": "A futuristic, professional AI studio OS design with deep dark backgrounds, vibrant accent glows, and massive editorial typography. The interface feels premium and 'cinematic' through the use of noise textures, glassmorphism, and subtle 3D transforms.",
  "style": {
    "description": "Cinematic dark theme with a layered background strategy (noise, grid, and mesh). Typography pairs the high-impact 'Cabinet Grotesk' for displays with the clean 'Satoshi' for body text. Motion is characterized by 'reveal-up' animations using custom cubic-beziers and floating micro-interactions.",
    "prompt": "### Visual Style Guide\n- **Color Palette**: \n  - Background: Primary Deep Navy `#0a0a0f`, Card Surface `#14141d` (60% opacity with 12px blur).\n  - Accents: Sky Blue `#0ea5e9`, Violet Accent `#8B5CF6`.\n  - Borders: Semi-transparent white `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`.\n- **Typography**:\n  - Headings: 'Cabinet Grotesk', weights 800-900. Tracking: `-0.05em` (tight). Line height: `0.9` for hero text.\n  - Body: 'Satoshi', weights 400-700. Tracking: `normal`.\n  - Mono: System Mono for technical metadata (size: 10px, uppercase, tracking: 0.2em).\n- **Background Effects**:\n  - Base: Grainy SVG noise texture (opacity 0.03).\n  - Middle: Moving grid (40px squares, stroke `rgba(255,255,255,0.05)`).\n  - Top: Radial mesh gradients in corners (#8B5CF6/10% and #0ea5e9/10% with 120px blur).\n- **Animations**:\n  - Text Shimmer: 5-color linear gradient moving at 6s duration.\n  - Reveal Up: `opacity: 0` to `1`, `translateY(40px)` to `0`, using `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)`.\n  - Hover: `scale(1.05)` for buttons with a drop shadow glow of `0 0 25px rgba(139,92,246,0.5)`."
  },
  "layout_and_structure": {
    "description": "A vertical landing page structure with fixed navigation, high-impact hero, 3D feature preview, bento-style feature grid, and a large-scale CTA section.",
    "prompts": [
      {
        "part": "Navigation",
        "prompt": "Sticky header (height 80px) with 90% opacity background and blur. Contains a logo group (icon + bold text), centered text links (gray-400), and two right-aligned CTAs (one text-link, one pill-shaped gradient button)."
      },
      {
        "part": "Hero Section",
        "prompt": "Padding-top 160px. Centered layout. Features an uppercase 'Beta' badge with a pulsing indicator. Main headline uses font-size 9rem (mobile 6rem) with a shimmering gradient on the second line. Followed by a max-width 3xl paragraph. Two large action buttons: one high-glow gradient, one glass-outline with a play icon."
      },
      {
        "part": "Stats Grid",
        "prompt": "A 4-column row separated from the hero by a thin border-top. Each cell contains a large bold stat (e.g., '10x') and a small uppercase technical description in primary blue with high letter spacing (0.2em)."
      },
      {
        "part": "Dashboard Preview",
        "prompt": "A 1400px wide container featuring a 'Perspective' 3D transform (rotateX: 6deg, scale: 0.98). The card is a glass-panel with 2rem border-radius. Inner content mimics a software interface: title bar with window controls (red/yellow/green), a sidebar with active states, and a main stage showing a generation progress bar."
      },
      {
        "part": "Features Grid",
        "prompt": "3-column grid of 'Glass Panels'. Each card has a 2.5rem radius, a custom icon in a 16x16 rounded box with a 20% border, and a 'glow-border' hover effect that changes border color and adds a soft purple outer shadow."
      }
    ]
  },
  "special_ui_components": [
    {
      "component": "Shimmer Headline",
      "description": "Animated gradient text that looks like light passing over chrome.",
      "prompt": "Apply a `linear-gradient(90deg, #fff 0%, #0ea5e9 25%, #8b5cf6 50%, #0ea5e9 75%, #fff 100%)` background to text. Set `background-size: 200% auto`. Animate `background-position` from -200% to 200% over 6 seconds linearly and infinitely. Use `-webkit-background-clip: text`."
    },
    {
      "component": "Glow-Border Card",
      "description": "Glassmorphic card that reacts to mouse hover with a neon border effect.",
      "prompt": "Background: `rgba(20, 20, 29, 0.6)`. Border: `1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`. On hover: `border-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.5)` and `box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2)`. Transition duration: 700ms."
    }
  ],
  "special_notes": "Must-do: Use the SVG noise filter as a fixed overlay on the entire site to prevent 'flat' digital looks. Must-do: Ensure all gradient buttons use a background-size of 200% and transition background-position for the hover effect. Must-not: Use solid colors for buttons; every call-to-action must have a subtle or vibrant gradient to maintain the 'cinematic' energy."
}

{
  "summary": "The 'Cinematic Momentum' system uses extreme typographic scale and depth layering to create a premium, editorial feel. It balances airy light backgrounds with sharp secondary colors and glass-like card components to convey 'momentum' and high-velocity business operations.",
  "style": {
    "description": "Premium editorial aesthetic using Plus Jakarta Sans for weight and Sometype Mono for technical precision. The color strategy relies on #FFFFFF/ #F7F5FB for space, #592B9B (Purple) for borders/accents, and #F16221 (Orange) for critical CTAs. Animations are swift (200-300ms) with a focus on 'staggered reveals' and scale-up hovers.",
    "prompt": "### Design Essence\n- **Color Palette**: \n  - Primary Background: `#FFFFFF` (White)\n  - Secondary Banding: `#F7F5FB` (Alt-lavender)\n  - Main Text/Ink: `#1A1523` (Deep Ink)\n  - Primary Accent: `#F16221` (Vibrant Orange)\n  - Secondary Accent/Structural: `#592B9B` (Purple)\n  - Borders/Dividers: `#ECE8F2` or `rgba(89, 43, 155, 0.1)` (Semi-transparent purple)\n\n- **Typography**:\n  - **Headers**: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', weights 700-800, tracking -0.04em. Massive sizing (clamp 3rem to 12vw).\n  - **Body**: 'Inter', 16px, color `#55505F`, line-height 1.6.\n  - **Kickers/Labels**: 'Sometype Mono', uppercase, weight 700, tracking 0.1em, color `#592B9B`.\n\n- **Effects & Depth**:\n  - **Glassmorphism**: `background: rgba(89, 43, 155, 0.03)`, `backdrop-filter: blur(4px)`, `border: 1px solid rgba(89, 43, 155, 0.1)`.\n  - **Shadows**: Soft elevation `box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04)` for static cards; `0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)` on hover.\n  - **Interactions**: 0.2s-0.3s `ease` transitions. Buttons scale 1.02 on hover. Nav links shift color to `#F16221`."
  },
  "layout_and_structure": {
    "description": "The layout follows a centered 1248px max-width container with generous vertical spacing (sections padded 128px-160px). It utilizes alternating background bands and modular grid systems (Bento/Card grids).",
    "prompts": [
      {
        "part": "Sticky Navigation",
        "prompt": "Fixed top bar, `#FFFFFF` with 90% opacity and `backdrop-filter: blur(12px)`. Horizontal padding: 2rem. Left side: Logo + Pulsing Red Dot (`#ef4444`). Center: Nav links in 14px bold sans-serif. Right: pill-shaped CTA in `#F16221` with white uppercase text."
      },
      {
        "part": "Hero Section",
        "prompt": "Min-height 100vh, centered flex column. Top kicker in 'Sometype Mono'. Headline in massive `10-12vw` weight 800 Plus Jakarta Sans, utilizing narrow line-height (0.9). Primary CTA button: Large orange pill with a 45-degree arrow icon. Secondary CTA: Ghost button with `#ECE8F2` border."
      },
      {
        "part": "Client Marquee",
        "prompt": "Full-width `#F7F5FB` band with 1px border top/bottom. Endless horizontal scroll of uppercase brand names/logos with `opacity: 0.2`. Spacing between items: 80px."
      },
      {
        "part": "Proof Grid (Stats)",
        "prompt": "Titled section on `#FFFFFF`. Grid: 5 columns. Each card is a 'glass-card' with `32px` rounded corners. Large stats (4xl) in `#592B9B`. Sub-label in 10px bold Mono font. 3D Card Depth: Cards use subtle perspective transforms on hover."
      },
      {
        "part": "Bento Story Grid",
        "prompt": "White background. Featured card: full-width aspect-video, includes top-left 'macOS traffic lights' (Red, Yellow, Green dots). Sub-cards: 2-column grid, aspect-4/3. Images must use `filter: grayscale(100%)` by default, transitioning to `grayscale(0%)` and `scale(1.05)` on hover. Overlay metadata appears on hover with semi-transparent `#1A1523` background."
      },
      {
        "part": "Pricing Table",
        "prompt": "Three-tier card system. Center card (Premium) must have a different border (e.g., `#592B9B` accent) and a small 'Most Relevant' badge. Side cards are 60% opacity. Include a 'Sample Brief' box below the cards using a `#F7F5FB` rounded container for contextual value."
      },
      {
        "part": "Contact Band",
        "prompt": "Full-width section with background `#1A102B`. Text is white. Massive headline `8vw`. Subtext opacity 60%. Key email address rendered at `4xl-6xl` size in `#F16221`. Background contains a subtle blurred radial glow (`#592B9B` at 20% opacity) in the bottom corner."
      }
    ]
  },
  "special_ui_components": [
    {
      "component": "Momentum Pulse Dot",
      "description": "Small status indicator next to logo.",
      "prompt": "A circular div, 8px diameter, background `#ef4444`. Apply infinite pulsing keyframe: `0% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); } 50% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(1.2); } 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }`."
    },
    {
      "component": "Cinematic Glass Card",
      "description": "Standard card for stats and service features.",
      "prompt": "Border-radius: 24px-32px; Background: `rgba(89, 43, 155, 0.03)`; Border: `1px solid rgba(89, 43, 155, 0.1)`; Backdrop-filter: `blur(4px)`; Hover state: `transform: translateY(-2px)`, `box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.06)`."
    },
    {
      "component": "Bento Traffic Controls",
      "description": "Visual indicator for featured video/image cards.",
      "prompt": "A flex row with 6px gap. Three circular divs, 12px diameter each: 1st color `#ff5f56`, 2nd color `#ffbd2e`, 3rd color `#27c93f`. Position in top-left corner with 32px padding."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "summary": "A comprehensive design system providing 6 visual identities for a delivery application. The system leverages a primary orange color (#F4511E) as a connective thread across various styles including minimalist light modes, high-luxury dark modes, and futuristic neon aesthetics. It emphasizes modular mobile layouts with specific focus on search UX, category navigation, and high-quality product cards.",
  "style": {
    "description": "The system features a primary brand color #F4511E across all variations but swaps secondary palettes and typography based on the desired emotional impact. Typography choices include Plus Jakarta Sans (Modern), Inter (Functional), Outfit (Luxury), and Space Grotesk (Tech). The visual theme varies from flat design with subtle shadows to glassmorphism, high-contrast neon glows, and sophisticated dark-mode layering.",
    "prompt": "Create a high-fidelity mobile UI using one of six specific visual profiles. Common tokens: Primary Orange #F4511E. \n\n1. **Premium Orange Style**: White background (#FFFFFF), rounded corners (radius: 16px-24px), Plus Jakarta Sans font (Bold 700 for headings), subtle 1px gray-100 borders.\n2. **Minimal White Style**: Soft gray background (#F8F8F8), Inter font, circular category icons with soft shadows (0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)), emphasis on whitespace and thin 400-weight typography.\n3. **Bold Dark Style**: Charcoal background (#121212), Outfit font, card surfaces #1A1A1A with 1px white/10 opacity borders, golden accents (#FFB84D), and glows using drop-shadow(0 0 15px #F4511E66).\n4. **Modern Gradient Style**: Warm base (#FFF9F5), gradient backgrounds (Linear #F4511E to #FFB84D), Plus Jakarta Sans, ultra-rounded buttons (radius: 32px), and energetic floating elements with shadow-orange-200.\n5. **Premium Commerce Style**: Structured light gray (#F5F5F5), Navy secondary (#2C3E50), Space Grotesk font, rigid grid layouts, and professional uppercase labels.\n6. **Next-Gen Style**: Deep black (#0A0D10), Space Grotesk font, neon accents (#FF6B35 and Cyan #00D9FF), radial gradients, and glassmorphism headers (blur: 20px, background: white/5)."
  },
  "layout_and_structure": {
    "description": "A modular mobile-first layout comprising a fixed header with location/profile, a scrollable body with hero banners and category grids, and a persistent bottom navigation bar.",
    "prompts": [
      {
        "part": "Comparison Hub Container",
        "prompt": "A desktop-view container featuring a 3-column grid of mobile viewports (375x812px). Background color #0F172A. Each viewport has a label with a title in White uppercase text and a subtitle in Slate-400."
      },
      {
        "part": "App Header Section",
        "prompt": "Mobile-first header (pt: 56px, px: 20px). Elements: A location selector with a map-pin icon and chevron-down; a circular profile icon or brand logo. Below this, a full-width search bar with radius 12px-16px, search icon, and placeholder text 'Search food, grocery...'."
      },
      {
        "part": "Hero & Categories",
        "prompt": "Horizontal scrollable hero section (h: 144px-176px) containing cards with promotional text and CTA buttons. Below, a category section using either a 3-column grid (square cards) or a horizontal scroll list (circular icons). Each category tile includes an icon and a bold label."
      },
      {
        "part": "Product/Restaurant Grid",
        "prompt": "Vertical list or 2-column grid of cards. Each card features a high-resolution image with aspect-ratio 16:9 or 1:1, a restaurant/product name, sub-details (tags, rating, time), and a price or status badge (e.g., 'HOT' or '4.8')."
      },
      {
        "part": "Bottom Navigation",
        "prompt": "Fixed bottom bar (h: 80px, pb: 34px for iOS home indicator). Icons: Home, Search/Discover, Cart/Orders, Profile. For the Modern Gradient style, the center icon is elevated in a floating circular button with a heavy shadow."
      }
    ]
  },
  "special_ui_components": [
    {
      "component": "Next-Gen Neon Search",
      "description": "A high-tech search input with a glowing perimeter effect.",
      "prompt": "Implement a search input inside a container with an absolute-positioned blur layer: '-inset-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FF6B35] to-[#00D9FF] blur opacity-20'. The input box itself is #11161D with a 1px white/10 border and Cyan #00D9FF icons."
    },
    {
      "component": "Elevated Action Button",
      "description": "A central floating navigation button with gradient and shadow.",
      "prompt": "A circular button (w: 48px, h: 48px) positioned centrally on the navigation bar, elevated by -40px. Background: linear-gradient to bottom-right #F4511E to #FFB84D. Border: 4px solid white. Shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(244, 81, 30, 0.4)."
    },
    {
      "component": "Glassmorphism Live Tracker",
      "description": "A floating status badge for live updates.",
      "prompt": "A pill-shaped badge with 'background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)'. Includes a pulsating 8px dot (color: #00D9FF) and tracking text in all-caps tracking-widest."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "summary": "An industrial, engineering-focused design system characterized by heavy-weight typography (800-900), a rigid 72px background grid, and a fixed-position scroll progress ruler. The theme uses a deep dark palette with electric blue highlights and meticulous mono-spaced labeling for a high-tech, architectural feel.",
  "style": {
    "description": "The style essence is 'Technical Brutalism'. It pairs the massive visual weight of Archivo (800-900) for headlines with the functional precision of Geist Mono for metadata. Colors are strictly controlled: a deep charcoal background (#101014), off-white primary text (#F2F1EE), and a signature 'Ship Blue' (#6B9EFF) for interactive elements and accents. Borders are thin (1px) and use low-opacity white (#F2F1EE at 16%) to create a blueprint-like appearance.",
    "prompt": "### Typography System\n- **Display Headlines (Archivo):** Use font-weight: 900 for Hero H1s (text-9xl, tracking: -0.075em) and 800 for Section H2s. Line-height should be tight (0.9 to 0.94).\n- **Body Copy (Inter):** Increase presence with font-weight: 500 or 600. Use text-lg for lead paragraphs and text-base for cards.\n- **Technical Labels (Geist Mono):** Use font-weight: 600-700, font-size: 11px, and uppercase with wide tracking (0.16em to 0.2em) for all tags, section numbers, and small UI labels.\n\n### Color Palette\n- **Background:** #101014 (Deep Onyx)\n- **Primary Text:** #F2F1EE (Warm Off-white)\n- **Accent/Blue:** #6B9EFF (System Blue)\n- **Muted Text:** #85858D\n- **Borders/Lines:** rgba(242, 241, 238, 0.16)\n\n### Visual Elements\n- **Background Grid:** 72px x 72px linear-gradient grid with 1px lines at 4.5% opacity.\n- **Borders:** 1px solid white/15 for containers and grid dividers.\n- **Animations:** Transitions for color and border-color should be 0.2s to 0.3s ease. Scroll-triggered transitions for section labels in the sidebar should include a subtle Y-axis slide (6px)."
  },
  "layout_and_structure": {
    "description": "The layout follows a modular bento-grid approach with a right-aligned fixed sidebar (The Ruler) and a fixed top navigation. Content is bounded by a 60px right margin to accommodate the sidebar.",
    "prompts": [
      {
        "part": "Top Navigation",
        "prompt": "Fixed header (height: 74px) with #101014 background and 1px bottom border. Left side: Branding (Logo with #6B9EFF slash). Center: Nav items in Geist Mono, 11px, uppercase, 0.16em tracking. Hover state: text color changes from #929298 to #F2F1EE. Right side: High-contrast button (background: #F2F1EE, text: #101014, font-weight: 700)."
      },
      {
        "part": "Hero Section",
        "prompt": "Full-screen (min-h-screen) centered layout on a 72px background grid. Features absolute-positioned mono labels in the corners for section numbering (01 / [Name]). Large H1 (900 weight) with blue accent words. Primary CTA: Bold blue button with arrow-down-right icon. Secondary CTAs: Outlined buttons with 35% opacity white borders."
      },
      {
        "part": "Grid Sections (Bento)",
        "prompt": "Standardized grid with 1px borders dividing cells. Card components have padding of 2rem (32px). Hover state: card border turns #6B9EFF, background gets a 4% blue tint, and the card translates -3px on the Y-axis. Every card starts with a mono-spaced badge/index number."
      },
      {
        "part": "The Ruler (Sidebar)",
        "prompt": "Fixed 60px wide sidebar on the right edge. Features vertical 'ticks' (small 14px, major 28px) at 5% intervals. Includes a vertical blue progress bar (#6B9EFF) with a 10px outer glow that fills based on scroll position. Section labels appear at 42% and 58% viewport height, rotating or fading as the user scrolls."
      },
      {
        "part": "Mega Footer",
        "prompt": "Divided into a 4-column grid by 1px borders. Top-level content uses massive display typography for branding. Links are Geist Mono, 11px, uppercase. Bottom bar features copyright and contact info spread across the width with 1px top border."
      }
    ]
  },
  "special_ui_components": [
    {
      "component": "Interactive Ruler Tick",
      "description": "A measurement-style sidebar component that tracks scroll progress.",
      "prompt": "A container with width 60px and a 1px left border. Ticks are generated every 5% of height. Major ticks (every 10%) are 28px wide; minor ticks are 14px. A 2px wide vertical 'fill' element in #6B9EFF moves from top to bottom based on scroll percentage. Numbers (Geist Mono, 10px) are placed to the left of the major ticks."
    },
    {
      "component": "Mono Badge",
      "description": "Industrial style numbering for list items or card headers.",
      "prompt": "Background color #6B9EFF with text #101014. Font: Geist Mono, 12px, weight 700. Padding: 0.5rem (8px) horizontally, 0.75rem (12px) vertically. No border-radius (sharp corners)."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "summary": "A sophisticated dark-themed fleet management portal with role-based views, featuring real-time telemetry cards, interactive mapping, and smoothed transitions using the View Transition API.",
  "style": {
    "description": "The style is 'Industrial Dark' with glassmorphism elements. It uses a base background of #09090B with panel backgrounds at #18181B (90% opacity) and borders using rgba(63, 63, 70, 0.4). Typography pairs 'Plus Jakarta Sans' for primary UI labels with 'JetBrains Mono' for all numerical and telemetry data to emphasize precision. Animations include smooth fade-ins (0.25s), toast slide-ins from the right (cubic-bezier 0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), and status pulse effects for critical units.",
    "prompt": "Create a high-tech dark mode dashboard using the following specs: Background: #09090B. Surface Panels: glass-panel style with background: rgba(24, 24, 27, 0.9), backdrop-filter: blur(12px), border: 1px solid rgba(63, 63, 70, 0.4). Primary Typography: 'Plus Jakarta Sans' (Weights 400, 600, 700). Data/Monospace Typography: 'JetBrains Mono'. Colors: Primary Blue (#3b82f6), Success Emerald (#10b981), Warning Orange (#f97316), Critical Red (#ef4444). Border Radius: 24px (3xl) for main containers, 16px (2xl) for cards. Scrollbars: 4px width, track: #18181B, thumb: #3F3F46. Animation: Use 'view-transition-name' for persistent elements (main-nav, toolbar, main-content) and a 0.25s ease-in/out fade for content transitions."
  },
  "layout_and_structure": {
    "description": "A three-column layout featuring a thin persistent sidebar, a central flexible workspace for mapping and analytics, and a right-aligned utility column for alerts and specific unit inspections.",
    "prompts": [
      {
        "part": "Navigation Sidebar",
        "prompt": "Persistent vertical sidebar, 280px wide. Dark zinc background. Includes a brand logo area, a role-based navigation list with active states (blue glow/indicator), and a bottom-aligned user profile/settings section. Features a badge for 'Incident Count' in red/orange."
      },
      {
        "part": "Header / Top Bar",
        "prompt": "Height: 64px (h-16). Flex layout, items-center, justify-between. Left side: Hamburger menu (mobile), search input (384px wide, #18181B bg, rounded-lg), and a Role Switcher (pill-shaped container with toggles for 'Ops' and 'Maint'). Right side: Live stream connectivity status (green text, mono font) and a notification bell with a blue pulse dot."
      },
      {
        "part": "KPI Grid",
        "prompt": "A 4-column responsive grid (sm:grid-cols-2, xl:grid-cols-4). Each card features a 2-column layout: Left contains a small icon in a colored background (10% opacity) and the metric label; Right contains a 'trend' badge (e.g., '+2.4%' or 'OPTIMAL'). The main value is large, bold JetBrains Mono text."
      },
      {
        "part": "Map Workspace",
        "prompt": "Central focus area. A container (540px height) with rounded-3xl corners. Inside: An SVG-based abstract map layout with a radial gradient mask (map-gradient). Includes HUD overlays: Left-top 'Layer Control' glass-panel checkboxes, Right-top 'View Controls' (maximize, layers). Floating dots representing assets with pulsing 'scooter-dot-pulse' animation for critical status."
      },
      {
        "part": "Analytics Bento Grid",
        "prompt": "A 2-column grid below the map. Left: 'Maintenance Forecast' with status items (Unit ID, Time to Failure) and a small bar chart for 'Battery Health Cohorts'. Right: 'Energy Load Dynamics' featuring a vertical bar chart and a bottom summary row with two metric cards (Total Drawn vs Avg Load)."
      },
      {
        "part": "Alert & Inspector Column",
        "prompt": "Right utility column. Top: 'Incident Pipeline' feed with a scrollable list of AlertItems. Each AlertItem has a severity color bar (left), title, timestamp, and short description. Bottom: 'Unit Inspector Card'—a high-detail telemetry display with live gauges for Speed, Charge, and Range, plus 'Lock/Unlock' action buttons."
      }
    ]
  },
  "special_ui_components": [
    {
      "component": "Role Switcher",
      "description": "A high-contrast toggle for changing global view states.",
      "prompt": "Design a pill-shaped container: background #18181B, border 1px zinc-800. Contains two buttons. Active state: background #2563eb (blue), color #ffffff, rounded-full. Inactive state: text #71717a, hover text #ffffff. Scale 90% on mobile, 100% on desktop."
    },
    {
      "component": "Unit Inspector Card",
      "description": "Advanced telemetry widget for specific asset tracking.",
      "prompt": "Dark panel (zinc-900) with 24px padding. Header: Unit ID in mono font with 'LIVE' status badge. Body: Three-column stats (Speed, Charge, Range) with bold values and small labels. Footer: Secondary action buttons (Lock, Unlock, Diagnostics) using ghost button styles (border zinc-800) and a primary 'View History' blue link."
    },
    {
      "component": "Toast Notification System",
      "description": "Fixed notification stack in the top-right corner.",
      "prompt": "Container fixed top-6 right-6, width 320px. Toasts have 16px rounding, border-left (4px) matching severity color (emerald for success, red for critical). Animation: slide-in from right (0.4s). Includes a 10px subtitle for detailed logs."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "summary": "A technical yet organic system that utilizes a blueprint-style loading state. It emphasizes 'draft to reality' transitions where components are first drawn as jittery SVG paths and then morph into clean, rounded cards. The aesthetic is professional, minimalist, and motion-centric.",
  "style": {
    "description": "full prompt",
    "prompt": "Build me a small React app that shows a "pencil sketch" loading state for a SaaS dashboard: the page sketches itself in blue pencil, each chart's sketch morphs to the real data while the numbers count up from zero, then the real UI fills in. A Replay button in the bottom-right corner runs it again.

Recreate it exactly. Create the project below with every file written exactly as given, character for character. Don't simplify, refactor, rename, reformat or "improve" anything: the animation depends on these exact values. Don't add any files beyond these.

Then run `npm install` and `npm run dev`, and open the local address it prints.

The logo and avatar load from hosted URLs, so there are no image files to add.

## Files

### `package.json`

```json
{
  "name": "pencil-sketch-loader",
  "private": true,
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "type": "module",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "vite",
    "build": "tsc && vite build",
    "preview": "vite preview"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "react": "^19.2.0",
    "react-dom": "^19.2.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@tailwindcss/vite": "^4.1.0",
    "@types/node": "^22.20.5",
    "@types/react": "^19.2.0",
    "@types/react-dom": "^19.2.0",
