{
  "summary": "A clean, modern user registration and management dashboard featuring a two-tab workflow, bento-style statistical overview, and a monochrome aesthetic. The design emphasizes clarity through ample whitespace, thick borders, and distinct typography pairings, suitable for professional service tools and membership systems.",
