      {
        "part": "Action Row",
        "prompt": "A horizontal layout containing: 1) A primary 'New' button in terracotta (#C2410C) spanning roughly 50% width. 2) A secondary 'Compare' button with a white background and '#292524' text. 3) A square 44x44px filter button. All elements must have a 14px corner radius."
      },
      {
        "part": "Editorial Content Cards",
        "prompt": "Horizontal layout cards. Left: 128x128px thumbnail area with tinted backgrounds (Olive #E9E9D8, Clay #F5E6D3, or Sand #F3EFE7) featuring a large, low-opacity icon and a bottom-aligned label tag. Right: Content area with a 16px Fraunces title, a secondary info row (location, status badges), and a 2x2 grid of specific data points (e.g., area, price, net profit) separated from the header by a fine line (#F5F2EE). Bottom-right: A profitability trend indicator using green text and a 'trending-up' icon."
