{
  "summary": "The Foreshore style is a cinematic, technical design system built on a deep #0a0a0b foundation. It uses a high-contrast 'Electric Cyan' accent to guide the eye through dense data. The interface prioritizes 'Reasoning vs. Action' through clear visual verdicts and technical provenance grids. It combines brutalist typography (7xl to 12xl headers) with delicate glass containers and WebGL-driven motion backgrounds for an 'elite-tech' feel.",
