  "style": {
    "description": "The design follows a 'Soft Professional' aesthetic. It pairs the high-contrast dark sidebar (#0f172a) with a light background (#f8fafc). Typography is handled by 'Plus Jakarta Sans', utilizing extreme weight contrasts (from 400 to 800) to create clear hierarchy. Components feature large corner radii (up to 40px/2.5rem for main cards) and subtle, soft shadows to denote depth without clutter.",
    "prompt": "### Visual Theme\n- **Primary Background**: #f8fafc\n- **Sidebar Background**: #0f172a\n- **Accent Colors**: \n  - Primary: #4f46e5 (Indigo)\n  - Success: #10b981 (Emerald)\n  - Warning: #f59e0b (Amber)\n  - Danger: #f43f5e (Rose)\n  - Info: #3b82f6 (Blue)\n\n### Typography\n- **Primary Font**: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif\n- **Secondary Font**: 'Inter', sans-serif for body text\n- **Headings**: Weight 800 (Extra Bold), tracking -0.02em\n- **KPI Numbers**: Weight 900 (Black), font-size 24px-32px\n- **Labels/Metadata**: Weight 700, font-size 10px-11px, uppercase, tracking 0.1em\n\n### Border & Elevation\n- **Border Radius**: \n  - Dashboard Cards: 40px (2.5rem)\n  - Buttons/Small Cards: 16px (1rem)\n  - KPI Icons: 12px\n- **Borders**: 1px solid #f1f5f9 (for light cards), 1px solid #1e293b (for sidebar items)\n- **Shadows**: \n  - Card Shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05)\n  - Sidebar Active Shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.4)\n\n### Animations\n- **Hover Transitions**: 300ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)\n- **Micro-interactions**: Subtle scale (1.02x) on card hover, color shifts on sidebar items."
  },
  "layout_and_structure": {
    "description": "A fixed-width sidebar (280px) provides primary navigation, supporting a fluid main content area. The main content is structured into a greeting header, a 5-column KPI row, and a multi-span 12-column grid for complex charts and lists.",
    "prompts": [
      {
        "part": "Sidebar Navigation",
        "prompt": "Width: 280px. Background: #0f172a. Top section contains a logo (40x40px rounded-xl box) and brand title. Navigation is grouped under uppercase labels (e.g., 'GESTION', 'FINANCES'). Items use 13px font-size, text-slate-400, with a right-aligned chevron icon. Active state: Background #4f46e5, white text, 12px-16px shadow-indigo-900. Bottom section features a specialized 'Help' card (#1e293b with border) containing a support icon and description."
      },
      {
        "part": "Sticky Header",
        "prompt": "Height: 80px. Background: #ffffff. Border-bottom: #f1f5f9. Left side: Menu toggle button and a search bar (400px width, #f8fafc bg, rounded-2xl, leading search icon). Right side: Icon group (notifications with red dot badge, messages, dark mode toggle), language selector with flag icon, and profile component (Avatar + Name + Role)."
      },
      {
        "part": "KPI Grid",
        "prompt": "Display in a 5-column grid. Each card is white, 24px padding, rounded-3xl. Elements: Icon in a colored background box (e.g., blue-50 for blue icons), label in 10px bold uppercase, value in 24px extra-bold, and a percentage change badge (emerald-50 bg for positive). Bottom of card features a simple SVG sparkline path colored to match the category."
      },
      {
        "part": "Main Analytics Area",
        "prompt": "12-column grid layout. Top row: (6-col) line chart for monthly trends with interactive nodes; (3-col) donut chart for distribution with custom legend; (3-col) list of top-performing items with avatars and star ratings. Bottom row: (4-col) vertical timeline for recent activity; (5-col) vertical bar chart for revenue with large currency total; (3-col) status summary with centered donut and percentage breakdown."
      },
      {
        "part": "Bottom Utility Section",
        "prompt": "A two-part grid. Left (8-col): A large promotional/tip banner with a gradient (#4f46e5 to #3730a3), 3rem radius, containing a glassmorphic floating element and a white primary CTA button. Right (4-col): An 'Actions Rapides' grid (2x2) of square cards with large centered icons and bold labels."
      }
    ]
  },
  "special_ui_components": [
    {
      "component": "Glassmorphism Promo Banner",
      "description": "High-impact call-to-action banner with depth effects.",
      "prompt": "Background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #3730a3). Border-radius: 48px. Internal padding: 48px. Right side features a floating 'glass' window using backdrop-filter: blur(12px) and white/10 opacity, tilted at 6 degrees. Typography inside: White, Extra Bold. CTA button: White background, #4f46e5 text, rounded-2xl, heavy shadow."
    },
    {
      "component": "Interactive Donut Chart",
      "description": "Custom SVG donut with centered metrics.",
      "prompt": "Central hole size: 70%. Stroke-width: 4-6px. Colors: emerald-500, amber-500, etc. Center content: Large number (3xl) and small 'Total' label (10px uppercase). Legend below: Dot indicators, flex-between layout, font-size 11px, bold weights for values."
    },
    {
      "component": "KPI Sparklines",
      "description": "Minimalist trend lines for quick visual analysis.",
      "prompt": "Implementation: SVG path with 'stroke-linecap: round' and 'stroke-linejoin: round'. Stroke-width: 2px. Fill: none. Height: 40px. The path should smoothly interpolate between 7-10 data points across the card width."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "summary": "A premium luxury design system characterized by an editorial aesthetic, using deep burgundy, gold, and warm cream tones. It balances minimalist layouts with rich decorative elements like subtle line patterns and organic, animated shapes. The design emphasizes calm and sophistication through breathing animations and high-contrast typography.",
  "style": {
    "description": "The style is defined by its 'luxury editorial' feel. Typography uses a mix of light-weight serifs for large headings (Crimson Pro) and modern, uppercase sans-serifs for meta-text (Poppins). The color system is anchored by Deep Burgundy (#8B3A47), Warm Cream (#F5E6D3), and Gold (#D4A574). Motion is subtle: breathing SVG circles for tranquility and smooth scroll-reveals (transform-Y: 20px) for interactivity.",
    "prompt": "Create a luxury editorial style UI using a palette of Deep Burgundy (#8B3A47), Warm Cream (#F5E6D3), Accent Gold (#D4A574), Muted Gray (#7A8A8E), and an off-white background (#FFFBF7). Typography must pair 'Crimson Pro' (headings, weights 300/400, italic variations) with 'Poppins' (body and navigation, weights 400/600). Use extremely wide tracking (0.2em) for small uppercase labels (10px). Backgrounds should include a faint line-pattern grid (linear-gradient, 40px square, 5% opacity). Buttons use #8B3A47 background with white text, sharp edges (rounded-sm), and high-contrast hover effects. Incorporate organic, fluid shapes (border-radius: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%) as background decorative elements with blur-2xl filters. Key animations include a 'breathing' effect for SVG circles (scale 1.0 to 1.15, opacity 0.3 to 0.6 over 8 seconds) and scroll-triggered fades."
  },
  "layout_and_structure": {
    "description": "Compact and premium layout with tight vertical padding (py-16 to py-24). Sections are separated by delicate borders (#E5D1B8) or subtle background shifts. Uses a mix of single-column centered quote sections, 2-column hero/editorial splits, and 3-to-4 column grids for services and social proof.",
    "prompts": [
      {
        "part": "Navigation",
        "prompt": "Sticky header with backdrop-blur (rgba(255,251,247, 0.98)). Logo on the far left in primary burgundy. Navigation links centered using 11px uppercase Poppins with 0.2em tracking. Add a hover micro-interaction where a small Lucide icon fades in next to the text. Far right includes a user icon and a 'Book' CTA button (10px, uppercase, high contrast)."
      },
      {
        "part": "Hero Section",
        "prompt": "Two-column split. Left side: Small pill-shaped tag, a large 7xl serif heading (Crimson Pro) with italicized emphasis, and a descriptive paragraph. Right side: Abstract animated visual instead of an image. Visual consists of concentric SVG circles with a breathing animation (scale/opacity) and a central Lucide icon pulsating softly."
      },
      {
        "part": "Service/Feature Grid",
        "prompt": "3-column grid of white cards with #E5D1B8 borders. Each card has a circular icon container that switches from cream to burgundy on hover. Includes a 2xl serif title, a small body text, and a bottom row containing a hidden 'View Details' label that appears on hover alongside a rotating '+' icon."
      },
      {
        "part": "Editorial/Quote Section",
        "prompt": "High-contrast section using the primary burgundy background (#8B3A47) and white text. Left side contains a vertical list of quotes with varying opacities (90%, 70%, 50%) paired with accent gold borders. Right side features floating glassmorphism cards and organic blobs spinning at 40s linear-infinite speeds."
      },
      {
        "part": "Social Proof / Testimonials",
        "prompt": "3-column grid using light backgrounds and quote icons. Each testimonial card is border-wrapped with a specific accent border on the central card for emphasis. Profiles include circular initials placeholders and 10px bold uppercase metadata."
      },
      {
        "part": "Shop / Gallery Grid",
        "prompt": "Grid of product or showcase cards. Square aspect ratio images with a slight 700ms scale-up transition on hover. Each card displays a serif title, price/meta in burgundy, and a full-width flat button that transitions from transparent to solid burgundy."
      },
      {
        "part": "Footer",
        "prompt": "4-column layout with primary burgundy text on the light background. Includes a newsletter/description block, two link columns, and a contact column with icons. Bottom bar contains copyright and utility links in 9px uppercase bold text with 0.2em tracking."
      }
    ]
  },
  "special_ui_components": [
    {
      "component": "Breathing SVG Meditation Visual",
      "description": "A tranquil, non-human visual element using animated geometry.",
      "prompt": "Create a centered SVG container (500px) with 3 concentric circles. Apply a CSS animation 'breath' (keyframes: 0% scale 1, 50% scale 1.15, 100% scale 1) with an 8-second duration. Use linear-gradient fills (#8B3A47 at 20% opacity to #D4A574 at 10% opacity). Layer a central Lucide flower icon at 20% opacity with a pulse effect."
    },
    {
      "component": "Organic Background Blob",
      "description": "Decorative fluid shapes that add a premium feel to backgrounds.",
      "prompt": "Design a CSS element with 'border-radius: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%'. Set background to #F5E6D3 or white/10% depending on parent section. Apply a 'blur-2xl' filter and position it as an absolute z-index -10 element to peek from behind content."
    }
  ],
  "special_notes": "Maintain strict vertical padding limits (max py-24 for large screens, py-16 for mobile) to keep the layout feeling premium and dense rather than sparse. Every section heading should have a 10px uppercase tracking label above it. Use Crimson Pro's italic variant for emotional emphasis within headings. Border-radius should be minimal (rounded-sm) except for decorative 'organic blobs'."
}

{
  "summary": "A complex, mechanical reactor core design utilizing dense SVG-based orbital paths, technical annotations, and a layered depth hierarchy. The aesthetic is defined by a warm amber-orange glow (#FFB400) against a void-black backdrop, featuring multi-layered rotation and trajectory-based motion choreography.",
  "style": {
    "description": "The style is 'Mechanical Blueprint Density.' Typography is strictly monospace (JetBrains Mono) for technical authority. The color palette transitions from bright Amber (#FFB400) for active signals to Deep Burnt Orange (#993300) for structural support, down to Deep Brown/Black (#1A0000) for background depth. Animations are a mix of constant linear rotations, ease-in-out gyroscopic sweeps, and rhythmic pulsing. Micro-interactions include 'energy packets' flowing through dashed paths and technical shutters that brighten and fade periodically.",
    "prompt": "### Visual Theme\n- **Base Color Palette**: \n  - Primary Glow: `#FFB400` (Amber)\n  - Secondary Active: `#FF8A00` (Orange)\n  - Mid-Structural: `#FF5A00` (Mid-Orange)\n  - Support/Low-tier: `#993300` (Dark Burnt Orange)\n  - Background Geometry: `#1A0000` (Deep Brown)\n  - Foundation: `#000000` (Pure Black)\n- **Typography**: \n  - Font Family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace.\n  - Weights: 300 (light), 500 (medium).\n  - Size: 10px to 14px for technical labels.\n- **Glow/Effects**:\n  - Soft Glow: `filter: drop-shadow(0 0 4px #FFB400)`\n  - Strong Core Glow: `filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px #FFB400)`\n  - Filters: Use SVG Gaussian Blur (stdDeviation 2-5) for layered bloom.\n- **Animation Curves**:\n  - Inner Gyro Sweep: `cubic-bezier(0.45, 0.05, 0.55, 0.95)` (12s cycle)\n  - Heavy Rotation: `ease-in-out` (38s cycle)\n  - Stable Anchor: `linear` (180s cycle)\n  - Nucleus Jitter: `cubic-bezier(0.42, 0, 0.58, 1)` (14s cycle)"
  },
  "layout_and_structure": {
    "description": "A radial structure organized into four depth planes: Foreground (High-intensity arcs), Middle (Inner gyros and nucleus), Peripheral (Satellite nodes and radials), and Background (Structural supports and faint ellipses).",
    "prompts": [
      {
        "part": "Central Nucleus Assembly",
        "prompt": "Create a core nucleus at (500,500). Elements: 32px radius circle (fill #000000, stroke #993300, 1.5px), an inner 20px circle (stroke #FF8A00, 0.5px, opacity 0.5), and a 4.5px solid #FFB400 bead at the center with a strong glow filter. The nucleus must travel along a local trajectory using translate(35px, -30px) over 14s while spinning locally."
      },
      {
        "part": "Inner Mechanical Ring (Shutter System)",
        "prompt": "Add a ring at radius 130px. Stroke: 2px #FFB400, dasharray '80 40'. Attach 'shutters': small rectangular blocks (8x10px, 6x12px) at irregular intervals (30°, 60°, 90°). Shutters pulse in brightness from opacity 0.3 to 1.0 using ease-in-out timing over 6s."
      },
      {
        "part": "Dominant Tilted Orbit",
        "prompt": "A major elliptical compound tilted at 35°. Primary ellipse: rx=450, ry=180, stroke #FF8A00 (2.5px), dasharray '400 600'. Add companion traces: one offset 4px out (#993300, 0.8px) and one offset 8px out (#FFB400, 0.6px) using an 'energy flow' dash-animation. Attach technical tick groups (rectangles 8x20px) at the extreme horizontal edges."
      },
      {
        "part": "Radial Trace Field",
        "prompt": "Static radial cage at origin. 38 irregular spokes radiating outwards. Lengths vary between 150px, 250px, and 320px. Thickness varies: 0.5px, 1px, 1.5px. Colors distributed: 20% #FFB400, 30% #FF8A00, 50% #993300. Spacing must be non-uniform (gaps of 8° to 22°) to avoid robotic symmetry."
      },
      {
        "part": "Peripheral Satellite Network",
        "prompt": "48 nodes scattered 320-480px from center. Node types: circles with stems (—○), targets (⊙), and partial circles (◐). Node sizes: 2px to 8px. 28 nodes rotate slowly (200s cycle), while 20 nodes remain static. 5-7 selected nodes pulse in scale (1.15x) and brightness."
      },
      {
        "part": "Background Support Field",
        "prompt": "Lowest depth layer. 50+ controlled paths. Includes long thin ellipses (rx: 200-350px, opacity 0.25), partial arcs (60-85% circumference), and double-trace pairs (3-6px gap). Primary color: #1A0000 and #993300. Use extremely slow-drift animations (80s to 300s) to create a sense of vast internal volume."
      }
    ]
  },
  "special_ui_components": [
    {
      "component": "Technical Shutter Gate",
      "description": "An animated mechanical gate that simulates internal reactor logic.",
      "prompt": "Construct using a SVG rect (e.g., 8px by 10px). Stroke: none, Fill: #FFB400. Apply keyframe animation 'shutter-travel': 0% opacity 0.3, 50% opacity 1.0 + brightness(1.8), 100% opacity 0.3. Cycle time 6s. Position these at specific degree points along an inner radius."
    },
    {
      "component": "Energy Flow Trace",
      "description": "A dash-animated line simulating data transfer.",
      "prompt": "Use an SVG path or ellipse. Stroke-width: 0.5px to 1px. Stroke-dasharray: '60 340'. Animation: 'energy-packet' linear infinite 2s duration. Stroke color: #FFB400. This creates a moving 'blip' along a circuit path."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "summary": "A sophisticated dark navy dashboard for multimedia asset management, utilizing tactile neumorphic effects, a central digital frame for file previews, and editorial typography with high-contrast mustard accents.",
  "style": {
    "description": "The style essence combines Neumorphism (soft UI) with high-tech functionalism. It uses 'Plus Jakarta Sans' for bold, editorial headings and 'DM Sans' for clean legibility. The color scheme relies on deep dark navy (#0f172a) for the background, with layers of shadows (#020617 and #1e293b) to create depth. Accent elements use a rich mustard yellow (#d97706) for call-to-actions and active states. Interactions include smooth scaling, translation on hover, and inner-glow reflections on the digital frame component.",
    "prompt": "Create a UI design with a background color of #0f172a. Use a two-tiered typography system: 'Plus Jakarta Sans' for headers (font-weights: 700, 800) and 'DM Sans' for body text (weights: 400, 500). Implement neumorphic effects using two shadow types: Flat (8px 8px 16px #020617, -8px -8px 16px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4)) and Inset (inset 6px 6px 12px #020617, inset -6px -6px 12px rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4)). Use an accent color of #d97706 for critical highlights and active indicators. Primary buttons and active badges should have a subtle inner glow (inset 2px 2px 4px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)). UI elements should have rounded corners ranging from 16px (small icons) to 32px (large panels/cards). Animation transitions should be 300ms using a standard ease-in-out curve, except for large preview scales which should use a 1000ms duration."
  },
  "layout_and_structure": {
    "description": "A structured dashboard layout with a top-level header, a horizontal stats strip, and a two-column main workspace (4:8 ratio) for navigation and preview.",
    "prompts": [
      {
        "part": "Header",
        "prompt": "A max-width 7xl container. Left side: Logo container (neumorph-flat) with a 40x40px mustard icon box and 'Plus Jakarta Sans' bold uppercase text. Right side: Administrator profile badge with a circular avatar inside an inset neumorphic ring and dual-line text metadata (light gray #4B5563 for labels)."
      },
      {
        "part": "Stats Grid",
        "prompt": "A 4-column grid of equal-width cards. Each card uses 'neumorph-inset' styling with 32px corner radius. Layout includes a top label in tiny (10px) all-caps font-weight 800 with 0.25em tracking, followed by a large (3xl) value. One card should highlight status using an emerald-500 color."
      },
      {
        "part": "File Navigation Sidebar",
        "prompt": "Occupying 4/12 of the grid. Title section with a 'Filter' dropdown link in mustard yellow. Vertical scrollable area containing file cards. Active card state: 'neumorph-inset' background, border color #d97706 at 30% opacity, and a vertical 1.5px x 40px mustard pill indicator on the far left edge. Inactive cards: 'neumorph-flat' that lifts slightly on hover."
      },
      {
        "part": "Digital Frame Preview Area",
        "prompt": "Occupying 8/12 of the grid. Features a large 'digital-frame' container: 28px border radius, background #020617, 1px solid #1e293b border, and a subtle top-left to bottom-right white gradient overlay (5% opacity) to mimic glass. Inside, a content 'screen' with 'neumorph-inset-deep' styling. Center includes a 112x112px floating glassmorphic play button (backdrop-blur-xl, white/10 border). Bottom contains a floating glassmorphic metadata panel with blurred background and dual-column technical details (Resolution, Elapsed Time)."
      }
    ]
  },
  "special_ui_components": [
    {
      "component": "Neumorphic Mustard Button",
      "description": "Tactile accent button with shadow and inner highlight.",
      "prompt": "Apply background #d97706, border-radius 12px-24px depending on size. Box shadow: 4px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4). Inner shadow: inset 2px 2px 4px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2). Text should be white or #0f172a for maximum contrast."
    },
    {
      "component": "Metadata Glass Panel",
      "description": "A floating info card with heavy background blur and semi-transparent borders.",
      "prompt": "Background color: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.8). Backdrop-filter: blur(24px). Border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05). Border-radius: 32px. Padding: 32px. Elements inside use high-contrast white text for titles and mustard (#d97706) for micro-labels."
    }
  ]
}

{
  "summary": "An editorial-grade dark mode portfolio featuring oversized typography, a dual navigation strategy, and a high-contrast coral accent system. The style blends minimalist Swiss-style layout principles with modern gaming-culture energy.",
  "style": {
    "description": "The style essence is 'Midnight Editorial'—sophisticated, dark, and bold. It relies on the Satoshi Variable font family for a modern, geometric look. The color palette is strictly controlled: #050505 (Background), #FF6B50 (Coral Accent), #EBEBEB (Primary Text), and varying shades of grey (#888888, #666666, #1A1A1A) for hierarchy. Layouts use large negative space, tight tracking (-0.05em), and 16:9 aspect ratios for imagery. Transitions are smooth (duration-700) with subtle floating micro-interactions.",
    "prompt": "Create a design with a background of #050505 and primary accent of #FF6B50. Typography must use 'Satoshi Variable' (or a similar geometric sans-serif like Inter). Hero headlines should be massive (13vw to 14vw), italic-free, with letter-spacing of -0.05em and line-height of 0.85-0.9. Navigation should include a fixed top bar and a floating bottom dock with backdrop-filter: blur(12px), rgba(17, 17, 17, 0.8), and a 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) border. Interactive elements should use cubic-bezier transitions for hover effects, including scale(1.05) on images and background color shifts from #1A1A1A to #FFFFFF for buttons. Selection color must be #FF6B50 with white text."
  },
  "layout_and_structure": {
    "description": "A single-page vertical layout featuring a minimalist fixed header, a massive hero section, a bento-style benefit grid, a staggered 2-column project gallery, and a high-impact typographic footer.",
    "prompts": [
      {
        "part": "Fixed Top Navigation",
        "prompt": "A fixed full-width header (px-6, py-6). Left side features a logo (a 32px rounded square, black text on white background) and a hidden-on-mobile link list in #888888. Right side features a text link and a button styled with a #333333 border, #1A1A1A background, and white text that inverts on hover."
      },
      {
        "part": "Floating Bottom Dock",
        "prompt": "A centered floating dock (bottom-8) using a glassmorphism effect (blur: 12px, background: rgba(17,17,17,0.8)). It contains a series of icon buttons separated by a vertical #333333 border, followed by a primary CTA button in #FF6B50 with black bold text (uppercase, tracking-wide)."
      },
      {
        "part": "Hero Section",
        "prompt": "A full-height (100vh) section with a radial gradient background (#1A1A1A to #050505). Center text is massive (13vw) and says '/thumbnails'. Bottom-left includes a social proof stack: three 40px grayscale avatars overlapping (-space-x-4) and two lines of #888888 text. Bottom-right features a single email link with a persistent bottom border that changes to #FF6B50 on hover."
      },
      {
        "part": "Benefits Bento Grid",
        "prompt": "A 2-column grid section. Column 1: A #111111 rounded-3xl (2.5rem) card containing oversized typography ('Higher CTR.') in white and grey. Column 2: A vibrant gradient card (emerald to blue) featuring a floating UI mockup. The mockup should have a '100 DAYS!' badge in #FF6B50 tilted at -12 degrees."
      },
      {
        "part": "Staggered Work Gallery",
