      },
      {
        "part": "Impact Footer",
        "prompt": "A footer featuring a massive two-line text block ('CRAFT MORE.') at 14vw font size. Includes a vertical stack for contact info and a horizontal row of 56px circular social icons with 1px borders (#333333) that lift (-translate-y-2) and invert color on hover."
      }
    ]
  },
  "special_ui_components": [
    {
      "component": "Floating Gaming Badge",
      "description": "A slanted, high-contrast badge used for gaming thumbnails or highlights.",
      "prompt": "Create a div with background-color: #FF6B50, padding: 8px 24px, border-radius: 8px. Font: Black, extra-bold, italic. Transform: skew-x(-12deg). Add an animation 'float' that moves the component translateY(-10px) over 4 seconds with an ease-in-out curve."
    },
    {
      "component": "Glassmorphic Dock",
      "description": "A high-end floating navigation container.",
      "prompt": "A container with background: rgba(17, 17, 17, 0.8), backdrop-filter: blur(12px), border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1), and border-radius: 1rem. Internal buttons should have a padding of 12px and a hover background of #222222 with transition-all duration-300."
    }
  ],
  "special_notes": "Maintain strict adherence to the #050505 background; do not use pure black #000000. Ensure the 'Satoshi' font tracking is tight to give it the editorial look. The coral #FF6B50 must only be used for the primary CTA, the 'pulse' indicator, and high-impact hover states. Images should defaults to grayscale or low-saturation (opacity 60%) and only reveal full color on active interaction to maintain the 'Midnight' mood."
}

{
  "summary": "A sophisticated dark-themed e-commerce storefront with a premium tech aesthetic, utilizing deep blue backgrounds, sky blue accents, and clean geometric sans-serif typography. It balances high-quality imagery with technical data presentation through mixed font families.",
  "style": {
    "description": "The style essence is 'Modern Professional Tech'. It uses a dark mode foundation (#0f172a) to make product imagery pop. Typography is a pairing of 'Space Grotesk' for high-impact headings and 'JetBrains Mono' for technical metadata. Colors are strictly controlled: Primary Sky Blue (#0ea5e9) for actions, Slate Gray (#94a3b8) for secondary text, and pure White for primary text. UI elements feature rounded corners (2xl/16px) and subtle border transitions.",
    "prompt": "Create a design with a 'Dark Tech' aesthetic. \n- **Color Palette**: Backgrounds: #0f172a (900), #1e293b (800), #334155 (700). Primary Accent: #0ea5e9 (Sky Blue). Text: White (#ffffff) for headings, #cbd5e1 for body, #94a3b8 for secondary metadata. \n- **Typography**: Primary font: 'Space Grotesk' (Weights: 400, 500, 600, 700). Technical/Meta font: 'JetBrains Mono'. \n- **Headings**: H1: 72px, bold, leading-tight; H2: 30px, bold; H3: 18px, semibold. \n- **Borders & Radii**: Use 16px (2xl) border-radius for cards and 8px (lg) for buttons. Borders should be #334155, transitioning to rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.5) on hover. \n- **Animations**: Use 'cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)' for all transitions. Product images should scale by 1.05 on container hover."
  },
  "layout_and_structure": {
    "description": "A structured landing page layout consisting of a fixed transparent header, a large-scale hero section with directional gradients, a responsive 3-column product grid, and a multi-column contact-focused footer.",
    "prompts": [
