{
  "summary": "A futuristic yet professional AI-driven operating system dashboard called JARVIS OS, optimized for executive workstations. It uses a deep charcoal/black background with layers of translucent glass panels, accented by soft cyan lighting and vibrant status indicators. The interface balances high-density data metrics with a breathable, minimalist layout.",
