{
  "summary": "A high-fidelity tactical intelligence dashboard interface in deep dark mode. The design emphasizes data veracity and situational awareness through a hierarchy of corroborated signals. It uses a clean, utilitarian aesthetic with sharp borders, subtle glow effects, and a mix of sans-serif and monospace typography to convey precision and technical reliability.",
  "style": {
    "description": "Tactical Dark Mode Style: Deep black-blue base (#080A0D) with subtle panel variations (#0B0E12). Border-driven architecture using #1A1D23. Typography combines 'Inter' (300-700 weight) for readability with 'JetBrains Mono' for technical data. Functional color logic: Blue=Info, Red=Critical, Green=Success, Amber=Warning. Animations include a global 8s linear scan-line and pulsing status indicators.",
    "prompt": "Create a design system with the following specs:\n- **Color Palette**: Backgrounds: Base `#080A0D`, Panels `#0B0E12`. Borders: Subtle `#1A1D23`. Accents: Primary Blue `#3B82F6`, Warning Amber `#F59E0B`, Critical Red `#EF4444`, Success Green `#10B981`. Text: Heading `#E2E8F0`, Muted `#94A3B8`, Sub-muted `#64748B`.\n- **Typography**: Primary Font: 'Inter' (sans-serif). Secondary Font: 'JetBrains Mono' (monospace) for timestamps, IDs, and confidence scores. Font Weights: Bold (700) for hero headlines, Semibold (600) for section titles, Medium (500) for navigation, Regular (400) for body copy.\n- **Effects**: Box shadows using `shadow-2xl` with subtle colored glows (`shadow-blue-500/5`). Use a 'scan-line' overlay: a 2px horizontal gradient (transparent, `#3B82F6`, transparent) animating vertically over 8s.\n- **Borders/Corners**: Use sharp or slightly rounded corners (`rounded-sm` or `rounded-lg`). Horizontal separators and container borders should be 1px solid `#1A1D23`."
  },
  "layout_and_structure": {
    "description": "A vertical long-form landing page structured into 5 distinct operational modules: Global Navigation, Hero Intelligence Map, Comparative Evidence Grid, Chronological Intelligence Timeline, and Modular Product Entry Points.",
    "prompts": [
      {
        "part": "Header",
        "prompt": "A fixed-height (14rem) sticky header with a bottom border (`#1A1D23`). Left: Logo mark (6x6 blue square with 'S32' text) and uppercase 14px SEMIBOLD navigation links. Right: 'Request Access' button in high-contrast white background with black text."
      },
      {
        "part": "Hero Section",
        "prompt": "Center-aligned hero with a 60px bold headline and 18px slate-gray subtext. Below the text, feature an 'Isometric Map Container': a 21:9 aspect ratio window with a dark map background. Include floating data cards: a 'Live Incident' card on the left with a red pulsing icon and a 91% progress bar; a 'Telemetry Feed' on the right with vertical chronological log entries. Apply a vertical scanning line animation across the entire map area."
      },
      {
        "part": "Visual Comparison Grid",
        "prompt": "A two-column grid titled 'One signal is not enough.' Column 1 (Unverified): A dark card with low-confidence amber badges and a dashed empty evidence area. Column 2 (Corroborated): A highlighted card with a blue border, high-confidence green badges, and a 2x2 grid of icon-led data modules (Sensors, CCTV, Reports, Official Signal)."
      },
      {
        "part": "Intelligence Timeline",
