        "part": "Navigation",
        "prompt": "A fixed, transparent top navigation bar. On scroll, it transitions to a dark background (#050505) with a backdrop blur. It includes a logo with a 45-degree rotated square icon and uppercase, widely spaced navigation links (Tracking: 0.2em, Size: 12px)."
      },
      {
        "part": "Hero Section",
        "prompt": "A full-height (100vh) section featuring a parallax background image (45% opacity) with a gradient overlay (Black to Transparent). Headline: Massive Syncopate text (Size: 9xl) with a gradient clip-text effect (Cyan-White-Purple). Include a small, pulsing pill badge above the title for 'Live' status or taglines."
