      "component": "Neon Conic Button",
      "description": "A button with a hidden rotating border animation.",
      "prompt": "Define a button with position:relative and overflow:hidden. Use a ::after pseudo-element with a conic-gradient (transparent to #00f2ff) that rotates 360 degrees indefinitely. The gradient should only be visible (opacity: 1) on hover, creating a 'tracing' neon light effect around the button border."
    },
    {
